'''Description:''' Clerics who take the Travel domain gain access to an improved list of bonus spells.[[Image:Id travel.gif|right|Travel]]
== Bonus spells ==
* Level 1 [[Entangle (spell)|Entangle]]
* Level 2 [[Web]]
* Level 3 [[Freedom of movement]]
* Level 4 [[Slow (spell)|Slow]]
* Level 5 [[Haste (spell)|Haste]]

== Notes ==
* This domain is especially powerful in low-magic worlds, where it may be the only method for a (pure) cleric to get access to the powerful ''haste'' spell.
